@startuml
autoactivate on
autonumber

actor "User" as User
participant ":System" as System

activate User

User -> System: asks to open the settings
System --> User: shows the settings with the current theme and language
User -> System: chooses a language (system, English or Portuguese)
System --> User: saves the choice and redraws the screen in the new language

note right of System
  The default language follows the system.
end note
@enduml
